{"id": "69327", "title": "恶", "author": "奥丁", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 10, "available": 10, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69327.htm", "intro": "奥丁的话∶\r\n\r\n由於在下因搬家事忙，所以失踪了一段日子，希望还有人记得小弟吧！原本\r\n写开的《午夜奸魔》因连载久远，剧情老化，所以暂时停一停，改写全新的作品\r\n《恶》。文中男主角其实跟午夜奸魔有所关连，而午夜奸魔的失踪实与酒井法子\r\n有关，难道法子肚内的骨肉？看过午夜的读者可能已心中有数，不过一切容後交\r\n待。\r\n\r\n现先送上新作《恶》，希望大家喜欢。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69327", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10614397.html", "available": true}, {"title": "6-9", "file": "10614398.html", "available": true}, {"title": "10-14", "file": "10614399.html", "available": true}, {"title": "15-17", "file": "10614400.html", "available": true}, {"title": "18-20", "file": "10614401.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-23", "file": "10614402.html", "available": true}, {"title": "24-28", "file": "10614403.html", "available": true}, {"title": "29-32", "file": "10614404.html", "available": true}, {"title": "33-36", "file": "10614405.html", "available": true}, {"title": "37-39完结", "file": "10614406.html", "available": true}]}